# =============================================================================
# GOLDEN RULE: NEVER COMMIT GAME FILES.
# This repository holds ONLY our own original art and documentation.
# No extracted textures, meshes, or packaged game/mod content belongs here.
# The patterns below exist to keep those files out by accident. The real
# safeguard is you being careful. When in doubt, leave it out.
# =============================================================================

# --- Unreal Engine / game assets (never commit these) ---
*.pak
*.utoc
*.ucas
*.uasset
*.uexp
*.ubulk
*.umap

# --- Build tool binaries, dotnet output, native libs ---
bin/
obj/
*.dll
*.so
tools/retoc*

# --- Operating system cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Editor / IDE folders ---
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- Local scratch / working directories (never for committed content) ---
extract/
work/
refmods/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE: We deliberately do NOT ignore *.png. Our ORIGINAL source icon art
# (PNG/SVG) lives in art/ and IS meant to be committed. Only the specific
# game-asset extensions listed above are blocked, not our own artwork.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
